<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
<data noupdate="1">
  <!--
    ONE structure, like the kontrolní hlášení next door: Czech EPO publishes a
    single dphdp3_epo2.xsd and overwrites it in place, so there is no older
    vzor to resolve to and nothing to fetch. Dating this from 2025 refused to
    export periods it was perfectly able to file — on the Money agenda, 62 of
    80 filed returns.

    ⚠️ valid_from here is a CONSERVATIVE BOUND, not a sourced one. 2016-01-01
    is the kontrolní hlášení's statutory floor (the KH schema states it: a
    document with DUZP before 1. 1. 2016 goes on DPHEVD instead). The VAT
    return itself long predates that and its own floor has NOT been
    established — it is borrowed deliberately, because it comfortably covers
    every period any current agenda holds while claiming nothing we have
    checked. If a return older than 2016 ever needs exporting, establish the
    real floor first rather than moving this date on the assumption it is
    safe.
  -->
